  "94373-accept": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Teo Hammerstorm",
   "npc": "257446",
   "questID": 94373,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Aye, the time's come, young $c. Ye've grown stout and sturdy, like the stone beneath our boots. Takin' up the $c's path shows ye've got the wisdom o' the mountain, even before ye've proven yerself. Ye've the grit of stone to walk the earth's path.\r\n\r\nBut to earn its favor, ye must face it proper. South o' here, the Frostmane trolls live in a cave.\r\n\r\nBring me two of the necklaces they wear, crafted from the Iceclaw bears. Then we'll speak more of yer future.",
   "time": 1791964418,
   "title": "Call of Earth",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Anvilmar"
  },
  "94373-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Teo Hammerstorm",
   "npc": "257446",
   "questID": 94373,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Patience, lad, is the earth's finest virtue. It's seen mountains crumble and rivers carve valleys--slow and stubborn, like a true $r. The earth calls to ye now, for trouble brews on the horizon. Return successful, and ye'll be one step closer to bein' whole.\r\n\r\nOthers may envy yer wisdom, but that's their burden to bear.",
   "time": 1791966258,
   "title": "Call of Earth",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Anvilmar"
  },
  "94374-accept": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Teo Hammerstorm",
   "npc": "257446",
   "questID": 94374,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Aye, sapta's a brew forged with magic, bindin' our spirit to the elements. Only a few $c know the recipe, and it's nae for the weak-willed. Drink it, and ye will see what others can't. Hold true--it's only to be drunk in a sacred place.\r\n\r\nHead north to the Spirit Stone, tucked at the end of a hidden path up the mountain. Drink it there... see what the earth has to show ye.",
   "time": 1791966260,
   "title": "Call of Earth",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Anvilmar"
  },
  "94374-complete": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Minor Manifestation of Earth",
   "npc": "5891",
   "questID": 94374,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Ah... $N... the earth welcomes you, even in this frozen land. Bound in body and spirit, you'll walk forward knowing the mountains are your strength, the plains your patience, and the world your essence.\r\n\r\nTo pass this rite, stand humbly before the earth. The other elements are not so still--they clash and roar. Learn their dual nature, even here among the snow and stone.",
   "time": 1791966392,
   "title": "Call of Earth",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  },
  "94375-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Teo Hammerstorm",
